1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,844
Pehli baar agent install hone ke baad, ek zaroori step hai — company mapping.

2
00:00:04,844 --> 00:00:07,171
Agent kholiye, Companies tab kholiye.

3
00:00:07,171 --> 00:00:10,443
Aapki Tally mein jitni companies hain, sab dikhengi.

4
00:00:10,443 --> 00:00:14,029
Har company ke saathi ek FLOWRA company assign karni hai.

5
00:00:14,029 --> 00:00:15,664
Dropdown se select kariye.

6
00:00:15,664 --> 00:00:19,565
Agar aap sirf ek company use karte hain, toh mapping easy hai.

7
00:00:19,565 --> 00:00:25,164
Multi-company setup mein carefully match kariye — wrong mapping se data mix ho sakta hai.

8
00:00:25,164 --> 00:00:26,564
Save Mapping dabaaein.

9
00:00:26,564 --> 00:00:29,568
Ho gaya — ab data uss company ke liye sync hoga.
